    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI B2B Sales Outreach Assistant.\n\nCreate a personalized first-contact sales email for the following qualified lead.\n\nLead Information:\nName: {{$json.name}}\nEmail: {{$json.email}}\nCompany: {{$json.company}}\nIndustry: {{$json.industry}}\nCompany Size: {{$json.company_size}}\nLead Score: {{$json.lead_score}}\nPriority: {{$json.priority}}\nPurchase Intent: {{$json.purchase_intent}}\nPain Points: {{$json.pain_points}}\nRecommended Action: {{$json.recommended_action}}\nAI Summary: {{$json.ai_summary}}\n\nWrite a concise, professional B2B sales email.\n\nRequirements:\n- Address the lead by first name.\n- Mention their company naturally.\n- Show that you understand their specific pain point.\n- Connect our automation solution directly to the pain point and requirements stated by the lead.\n- Base personalization only on the Lead Information provided.\n- Do not make generalized claims about the company's performance, industry, competitors, or business results.\n- Use the recommended action as the call to action.\n- Do not sound like a generic marketing email.\n- Do not make unsupported claims or assumptions.\n- Do not claim to have researched or followed the company unless that information is explicitly provided.\n- Keep the email between 100 and 150 words.\n- Professional but conversational tone.\n- Do not use emojis.\n\nEmail Format:\n- The first line must be exactly:\n  Hi [First Name],\n- Replace [First Name] with the actual first name from the Lead Information.\n- Leave exactly one blank line after the greeting.\n- Start the main email content on the next line.\n- Write the main email content in 2–3 short paragraphs for readability.\n- Leave exactly one blank line after the main email content.\n- End the email with exactly these two lines:\n  Best regards,\n  Pavan R V\n- \"Best regards,\" and \"Pavan R V\" must always be on separate lines.\n- Do not add any text after \"Pavan R V\".\n- Never use placeholders such as [Your Name], [Name], [First Name], or similar placeholders in the final email.\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Return only the email subject and email body in the required structured output format.\n- Do not include explanations, notes, analysis, markdown, or code blocks.\n- The body must contain the complete formatted email, including greeting and signature.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
